## Gray Ooze

Gray oozes are eyeless and strike with limbs of themselves, and can hold what they catch. One kept the sewage works in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sewers|royal waterways]].

## Ochre Jelly

Ochre jellies are yellow, boneless oozes that lash out with limbs of themselves and hold what they catch. A blade cuts into one and it comes apart into two, and what is killed melts down to a puddle of water. They can throw a wash of acid over a room and lay a curse that ages a person for a moment.

## Living Tar

Living tar is a black ooze that usually hangs from ceilings but can move along the floor faster than its look suggests. A blade that strikes it sinks in and sticks, and it gathers loose rock into itself and throws it. The one that kept the sewage works in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sewers|royal waterways]] with the jellies is dead.

## Verdant Ooze

An ooze lives in the mid-boughs of the [[Verdant Expanse]] near where travellers enter from [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]]. Its only sign is a faint, almost mucus-like residue left on the trees where it has passed. Nobody has yet seen what kind it is.
